WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
My name is Jared Isaacman. I am the

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.359
administrator of NASA. I get the

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.200
privilege of leading the world's most

00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:09.360
accomplished space agency during the

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.880
golden age of science and discovery. We

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.759
are going back to the moon. We're here

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.440
with Artemis 3. They launch in 2027.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:16.560
>> We are so excited to represent America

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.880
and the American people.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.560
>> Europe wants to be the strongest and

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.680
most reliable partner for the

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.720
exploration of the moon.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.600
>> We're launching a bunch of different

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.359
rockets from the SLS to the Starship and

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.599
to the Blue Origin rocket. It's going to

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:32.000
be fantastic. laying the groundwork for

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:34.239
the next phase of human exploration.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
>> Our mission to launch next year shows

00:00:34.239 --> 00:00:37.600
American leadership in space and the

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.200
Artemis program leading humans back to

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:45.800
the moon and onto Mars to lead humanity

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.800
and America in space.
